      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agreed the trollers are annoying. I use presentation room a lot to talk with others, but if someone keep pressing reset button, it's getting more annoying.\nEven if someone make nice drawing and it just vanished. Oh that is stupid.\nMost players who pressed it are grayed colored. They're new visitors!\n\nIt seems reset button is too direct to erase everything. A cooldown timer is one simple solution, so trolling will much less. And i can write something before it's erased again. Cooldown timer is most easy because troller don't want wait for it. 2 min cooldown for example.\n\nTwo button is another idea, with 2 sec delay. so 2 players are needed to reset it. Put button at each side of the podium.\nButton-confirm version is two button version, but other is locked for same player. Need another player to press 2nd button. Pressed button can color green as reaction. Must pressed before 30 sec timer reset button. Both buttons can placed at same spot.\nThird option: Button reset will only remove your drawings immediately. Full erase has 2 min delay with another colored button.\n4th option: new visitors cannot reset room immediately with long cooldown delay. Trusted users can do it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
